# Project rules

- Stack: Next.js App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind, shadcn/ui, Zustand (UI only), Supabase, Recharts, Vercel-only deploy.
- Brand: "Dương Vũ". Assets in `public/brand/`. Theme: navy + blue (`globals.css`); display font `font-display` (Josefin). Commercial ref: duongvuvn.com. All UI text in Vietnamese. Dark mode supported.
- Agents follow AGENTS.md: design → plan → implement → `pnpm lint && pnpm typecheck && pnpm test`.
- No org/business schema until product is defined. Tables: `auth.users`, `import_batch`, `spend_line`.
- No service-role keys in client or `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` env vars.
- Prefer surgical diffs; no speculative abstractions or extra features.
- Prefer shadcn/ui (`src/components/ui/`) over hand-rolled controls; see rule `use-shadcn` and skill `use-shadcn`.
- "HOAI" is an employee name — never use as brand/feature label.
- Spend: `src/components/spend/`, `src/lib/spend/`. Data management: `src/components/data/`. Auth chrome: `AuthShell` / `AuthBrandPanel`.
- App API (Server Actions): `src/api/`.
- Specs live in `docs/superpowers/specs/`; plans in `docs/superpowers/plans/`.
